  "label": "baby orangutan is mapped as 'their baby pic'",
  "description": "The text 'tell them i found their baby pic' implies that the baby orangutan is being treated as a 'baby' in the human sense, creating an analogical mapping where the visual entity (baby orangutan) is mapped onto the textual concept of 'their baby pic'. This mapping relies on anthropomorphism and the visual similarity between human infants and baby primates to generate humor. The text explicitly refers to the visual material as if it were a human baby photograph, projecting human social media behavior onto the animal.",
